{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NAM","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"那鴻書","commonName":"那鴻書","title":"那鴻書","order":34,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"6864a0b55315302c1d2f10b5b4421eee104e8e7528ba32c5bd70e07385cb10b5","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NAM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NAM/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":47},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是關於尼尼微的預言，是伊勒歌斯人那鴻的異象錄。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華向尼尼微發怒"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"耶和華是痛恨不貞、施行報應的上帝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華施行報應，充滿烈怒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華報應祂的仇敵，向他們發烈怒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華不輕易發怒，大有能力。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華斷不以有罪的為無罪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂行走在旋風和暴風中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雲彩是祂腳下的塵土。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂斥責大海，使大海乾涸；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使一切河流枯竭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴珊和迦密的草木凋零，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"黎巴嫩的鮮花衰殘。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在祂面前，群山震動，丘陵消融。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在祂面前，大地隆起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世界和世上的一切都戰慄。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂發怒，誰能站立？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂發烈怒，誰能承受？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的憤怒如火焰噴湧而出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"磐石在祂面前崩裂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華是良善的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是人患難時的避難所；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂看顧那些信靠祂的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必用滔滔洪水毀滅尼尼微，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把祂的敵人驅逐到黑暗中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"尼尼微人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們為何圖謀抵擋耶和華？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂要徹底毀滅你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無需擊打兩次。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們像糾結的荊棘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像酩酊大醉的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要如乾稭被火燒盡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們中間出來一人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一個邪惡的陰謀者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"圖謀抵擋耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「儘管尼尼微勢力強大、人口眾多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但必被剷除，化為烏有。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民啊，我使你們受了苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但必不再使你們受苦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在我要打碎他們套在你們頸上的軛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鬆開你們身上的鎖鏈。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尼尼微啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華已發出有關你的命令：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你的名不會傳於後世。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要摧毀你神廟中雕刻和鑄造的偶像。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要為你掘好墳墓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你毫無用處。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"看啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"傳喜訊、報平安的人穿山越嶺而來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"慶祝你的節期，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"還你許的願吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"邪惡之人將不再侵擾你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們都將被徹底毀滅。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NAM/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NAM/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}